# Template for .env.local (copy it: cp .env.example .env.local). .env.local is gitignored.
# These values point the host-run app (npm run dev) and the DB scripts at the local Docker stack:
# they are LOCAL-ONLY demo secrets (docker-compose.yml defaults), safe to commit here.
# Real secrets (API keys) go only in .env.local. Production values live in .env.prod (gitignored,
# never loaded automatically): use them explicitly, e.g. node scripts/dev/with-env.ts .env.prod <command>.

